{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383740/extras/6eef512a388dc6a31ac47a00c801f6f3.avif?t=1763211539\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u262dMy Cute Commissar\u262d</strong> is a satirical historical visual novel with \u201cmatch-3\u201d gameplay elements. Take part in the political struggle in 1920\u2019s communist Russia! Take power into your own hands and bring Trotsky or Stalin to a ruling position! Get to know the leaders of the Russian communist movement intimately. Ignite the flames of world-wide revolution or build communism in one country! The choice is yours! \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u262dStalin\u262d</strong> \u2013 a young, beautiful lady who follows the ideas of communism but does not believe in world-wide revolution. She wants to seize power and build communism in one country through industrialization and the Great Purge. \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383740/extras/b43c0a4bfa34bd59896c5762cbe92262.poster.avif?t=1763211539\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383740/extras/b43c0a4bfa34bd59896c5762cbe92262.webm?t=1763211539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u262dTrotsky\u262d</strong> \u2013 a naive girl obsessed with dreams of permanent revolution and freedom for the proletariat. You may call her a fanatic, but she certainly doesn\u2019t look like one. Power and personal gain do not interest her at all. Her only goals: military communism and freedom for all oppressed people, no matter the cost! \u2665</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love story in a 1920\u2019s Russian setting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute Stalin and even cuter Trotsky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic visual novel with Match-3 gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lofi hip hop by G374</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383740/extras/0daab2794c4c8e0d86ec5ebeaca4fa2e.webp?t=1763211539\" width=616 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not contain intolerance, political propaganda, or official symbols of any real political organizations. Only love and mutual understanding. <strong>Make Match-3, not war \u2665</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7031fb83e99d940968cda30e682a99f2eff2f244.jpg","localized_name":"Start","name":"Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1383740/7031fb83e99d940968cda30e682a99f2eff2f244.jpg"},{"icon":"9c473f335fd782c5e464e3c810b438354391ba23.jpg","localized_name":"Cute Girls","name":"Cute Girls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1383740/9c473f335fd782c5e464e3c810b438354391ba23.jpg"},{"icon":"06ca4e256363da4cad76f4706e8f53b343ee7396.jpg","localized_name":"A","name":"A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1383740/06ca4e256363da4cad76f4706e8f53b343ee7396.jpg"},{"icon":"4bc66380d9c5226496c20d1d160afa30c96f6f63.jpg","localized_name":"Soviet food","name":"Soviet food","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1383740/4bc66380d9c5226496c20d1d160afa30c96f6f63.jpg"},{"icon":"4c3950b8be20046312abbd56426b38a3418370b5.jpg","localized_name":"Stalin's mustache","